Put your source video in this folder.

Any common video format works (.mp4 .mov .mkv .webm .avi .m4v .mpg .wmv .flv).
The agent finds it automatically - no configuration needed.

If you keep more than one video here, the agent will stop and ask which you
mean rather than guessing. Set VIDEO_PATH in your .env file to choose:

    VIDEO_PATH=data/my_recording.mp4
